OST REPLAY row: a bonus hop and a Toe for +2, an empty Dubki, a Toe for +2, then a greedy four-touch raid that got him caught). Beat his 4 in 4 raids. No defending, no clock pressure. Aha: his replay is your scouting — copy what worked (hop the bonus while seven stand), skip the empty raid, and never make his last-raid mistake of a fourth touch.","mechanics":["ghost duel","bonus line","toe touch","hand touch","dubki"],"optimal":null,"branching":18,"trap":null,"explored":40000},{"n":22,"grid":"[Full Match · boss · Ch2 District Cup] OPP MAT: A T T B T T A · grip 0.68 · KEY: A ankle-catcher (Toe/hop/Dubki risky), T thigh-holder (Hand/walk risky), B blocker (Dash risky)\nMY SIDE: o o o o o o o (7 on mat)\nFLOW: alternate raids 31:40→40:00 (~12 raids in all, ~6 each) · start score 16-17\nMY MOVES: hand toe bonus walk dash dubki pull | DEFENCE: ankle thigh block hold\nCPU RAIDER \"District captain\": s 0.50 · Easy · touches hand/toe/bonus · home walk/dash/dubki · up to 2 touches\nREAD (gem % held) touch: 1A:h21/t33 2T:h44/t24 3T:h45/t11 4B:h37/t12 5T:h45/t11 6T:h44/t24 7A:h21/t33 bonus:42 | home after 1 touch: walk 56%, dash 42%, dubki 43% | after 2: walk 67%, dash 52%, dubki 53% | if held: pull 41%\nREAD (gem % stop, made by the cover): vs his touch — hand: ankle 20/thigh 52; toe: ankle 53/thigh 19; bonus: ankle 32/thigh 22 | vs his way home — walk: ankle 21/thigh 37/block 27; dash: ankle 34/thigh 18/block 52; dubki: ankle 38/thigh 6/block 9 | his touch lands 82% if untackled\nGOAL: win by 1+ | STARS: Win by 4; Win by 7\nPROOF (validate, real engine, fresh match seeds): a competent player won 35/40 (best 3★), a mid-skill player 86/100","legend":"KABADDI RAID TRIAL (content unit; the player raids and defends in turns). OPP MAT = 7 defender slots, left corner → right corner ('-' = out). Defender traits: o rookie; T Thigh-holder (beats Hand Touch + walking home); A Ankle-catcher (beats Toe Touch, bonus hop, Dubki); B Blocker (midline wall, beats the Dash home); R Rusher (ch