sign a Corner)","player roles","hold specialists","anchor","cover","feints","defender switch"],"optimal":null,"branching":2,"trap":null,"explored":40000},{"n":45,"grid":"[Super Challenge · teach · Ch5 Continental Cup] OPP MAT: o o o o o T o · grip 1.25 · KEY: o rookie, T thigh-holder (Hand/walk risky) · no scouting on this trial (no SCOUTED tags)\nMY SIDE: o o o o o o o (7 on mat)\nFLOW: you raid 4x\nMY MOVES: hand toe kick bonus walk dash dubki pull lunge\nREAD (gem % held) touch: 1o:h14/t12 2o:h18/t16 3o:h18/t16 4o:h18/t16 5o:h39/t17 6T:h55/t17 7o:h36/t13 bonus:14 | home after 1 touch: walk 41%, dash 25%, dubki 24% | after 2: walk 51%, dash 32%, dubki 30% | if held: after 0/1/2 touches — pull 35/35/35%, lunge 51/34/17%\nGOAL: 1x superRaid | FAIL: raider out 3x | STARS: Never get caught; Super Raid within 2 raids\nPROOF (validate, real engine, fresh match seeds): a competent player won 36/40 (best 3★), a mid-skill player 71/100","legend":"KABADDI RAID TRIAL (content unit; the player raids and defends in turns). OPP MAT = 7 defender slots, left corner → right corner ('-' = out). Defender traits: o rookie; T Thigh-holder (beats Hand Touch + walking home); A Ankle-catcher (beats Toe Touch, bonus hop, Dubki); B Blocker (midline wall, beats the Dash home); R Rusher (charges: beats hops and touches; a Backward Kick tags him, but a Rusher standing NEXT to the kicked man charges the turned back — k = Kick held %, '(lands N)' = the Kick's landing chance); C Chain link (two adjacent C's chain: beat walk/dash home, Dubki ducks under); K rival captain (strong at everything except his one listed weakness). Danger comes from the target and his neighbours and grows with every touch already made. SCOUTED: only on trials whose OPP MAT row says SCOUTED, a move used on my previous raid is read — its gem shows a SCOUTED tag and the higher % (capped at ~8 points); rows that say 'no scouting' never show the tag. READ rows = the % the game shows on each option gem, never a recommendation