ch, half-time swap at 10:00) · start score 5-6\nMY MOVES: hand toe kick bonus walk dash dubki pull lunge | DEFENCE: ankle thigh block rush chain hold\nCPU RAIDER \"Continental captain\": s 0.68 · Medium · touches hand/toe · home walk/dash/dubki · up to 2 touches\nMOMENT (reversal, at half-time): \"HALF-TIME REVERSAL! They drop the Cage for an Ankle Line — four Ankle-catchers read the Dubki and the Toe.\" → OPP MAT becomes A T A o A T A (new: A ankle-catcher (Toe/hop/Dubki risky), T thigh-holder (Hand/walk risky))\nREAD (gem % held) touch: 1o:h20/t18 2C:h32/t29 3C:h32/t29 4o:h28/t25 5C:h32/t29 6C:h32/t29 7o:h20/t18 bonus:15 | home after 1 touch: walk 72%, dash 73%, dubki 25% | after 2: walk 82%, dash 83%, dubki 33% | if held: after 0/1/2 touches — pull 22/22/22%, lunge 37/20/4%\nREAD (gem % stop, made by the cover): vs his touch — hand: ankle 17/thigh 45/rush 26/chain 43; toe: ankle 46/thigh 16/rush 28/chain 39 | vs his way home — walk: ankle 17/thigh 29/block 22/rush 13/chain 41; dash: ankle 27/thigh 14/block 42/rush 9/chain 35; dubki: ankle 30/thigh 5/block 7/rush 13/chain 11 | his touch lands 87% if untackled\nGOAL: win by 1+ | STARS: Win by 4; Land a chain tackle\nPROOF (validate, real engine, fresh match seeds): a competent player won 37/40 (best 3★), a mid-skill player 71/100","legend":"KABADDI RAID TRIAL (content unit; the player raids and defends in turns). OPP MAT = 7 defender slots, left corner → right corner ('-' = out). Defender traits: o rookie; T Thigh-holder (beats Hand Touch + walking home); A Ankle-catcher (beats Toe Touch, bonus hop, Dubki); B Blocker (midline wall, beats the Dash home); R Rusher (charges: beats hops and touches; a Backward Kick tags him, but a Rusher standing NEXT to the kicked man charges the turned back — k = Kick held %, '(lands N)' = the Kick's landing chance); C Chain link (two adjacent C's chain: beat walk/dash home, Dubki ducks under); K rival captain (strong at everything except his one listed weakness). Danger comes from t